# Rap Sheet Finder does NOT need any environment variables to run.
# `npm run dev` works with no .env file.
#
# FUTURE (not implemented): an optional AI explanation helper would call a
# SERVER-SIDE route. Never put a model API key in a VITE_* variable — anything
# prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the public client JavaScript.
#
# AI_PROVIDER=disabled
# AI_SERVER_ENDPOINT=
